%% TECH-019 Test suite budget
%% How the time limits are kept: the report of the browser tests is checked in CI.
flowchart TD
    A[Pull request] --> B[CI runs npm run test:local with the JSON report]
    B --> C{Tests pass?}
    C -- no --> F[Job fails: test report saved]
    C -- yes --> D[check-test-time.mjs reads the report]
    D --> E{Total and every test within the limits?}
    E -- yes --> G[Job passes]
    E -- no --> H[Job fails: names the limit and the slowest tests - TECH-019-R3]
